## Database Schema Integration

### Existing Tables (Used)
```
- news_events
  └─ relevant, impact_type, impact_score, city, headline

- vehicles
  └─ current_facility_id, identifier, status

- facilities
  └─ city, latitude, longitude

- recommendations
